      "Levoit lists noise under 28 dB",
      "Compact enough for a desk corner or dresser"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "No humidistat or smart controls, so output is set by hand",
      "Ultrasonic mist leaves white dust with hard tap water",
      "Too large to be a true desktop or travel unit"
