  {
    "id": "pure-enrichment-mistaire",
    "name": "Pure Enrichment MistAire Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier",
    "badge": "Best for Desks and Nightstands",
    "category": "Ultrasonic Cool Mist, 1.5 L Tank, Tabletop",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "description": "The original 1.5-liter MistAire is the tabletop humidifier to buy when the Levoit is more machine than your desk wants. Retail listings for this model give up to 25 hours on low and up to 12 hours on high, a rating for rooms up to 250 square feet, a 360-degree adjustable nozzle and automatic shut-off when the tank runs dry. The adjustable nozzle matters more on a desk than people expect: you can aim the mist away from a monitor and keyboard rather than straight up into the air above them. Be realistic about the run-time figure, though. One retailer lists 16 hours on low, and a 1.5-liter tank cannot deliver 25 hours at any output that does much for a 250 square foot room. Treat it as a strong personal and small-room unit that you refill daily, not a set-and-forget room humidifier. Pure Enrichment advertises a long warranty on its own site; confirm the term on the listing you buy from.",
    "pros": [
      "1.5 L tank fits a desk, nightstand or bookshelf",
