        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          position: 3,
          name: "Best Small Humidifiers",
          item: "https://www.thehonestreviewers.com/best-small-humidifier/",
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      mainEntity: [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do small humidifiers actually work?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, for the right job. A small humidifier is effective at moistening the air near you, which helps with a dry throat, dry eyes or a dry hotel room. It will not raise the humidity of a whole room unless its tank and output are large enough, roughly 3 liters and over 100 ml an hour for a small closed room. Check tank size before you buy."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
