          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best small humidifier for most people is the <strong class="text-white">Levoit Dual 150</strong>, because its 3-liter tank is big enough to actually move a small office or bedroom while staying quiet and compact. For a desk or nightstand, the <strong class="text-white">Pure Enrichment MistAire</strong> is the right size, and with hard water the <strong class="text-white">Vornado EV100</strong> keeps white dust off your electronics.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
